{%- comment -%}
  us-compliance-block

  One shared, market-aware US compliance component for the approved Omni and
  Anja booths. It is rendered once from snippets/product-template.liquid so a
  single source produces the block on every applicable PDP. There is no
  per-model hardcoded compliance copy anywhere in the theme.

  It renders only when all of the following are true:

    * the active market country is the United States;
    * the product is in the APPROVED US product set
      (snippets/sbs-us-eligibility.liquid, scope: 'approved');
    * the product is in the COMPLIANCE-BLOCK set
      (snippets/sbs-us-eligibility.liquid, scope: 'compliance_block').

  The compliance-block set deliberately excludes the three Folio models. Their
  existing tick list and specification content already state 120V, UL Listed
  and ISO 23351-1 for US sessions through snippets/us-product-copy.liquid, so
  rendering this block on Folio would duplicate an equivalent compliant
  section.

  Content rules for the US Catalogue Expansion release:

    * Electrical wording is limited to the approved public wording 120V. No
      socket quantity, USB quantity or connector standard is stated because
      those values are not proven for the US configuration.
    * Compliance wording is limited to the approved public wording UL Listed.
      'UL certified', 'full UL certification' and 'CE / UL certified' are
      never emitted, and no listing number or testing laboratory is named.
    * ISO 23351-1 is shown only for products whose existing content already
      supports the standard (scope: 'iso_23351'). It is never introduced as a
      new claim and it is never described as a certification or an
      accreditation.
    * The commercial note states only that the product is available by
      quotation and that delivery, installation, taxes and duties are
      confirmed in the quotation. It never claims stock, free delivery, taxes
      included or a fixed lead time.

  Usage:
    {%- render 'us-compliance-block', product: product -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign us_cb_render = false

  if localization.country.iso_code == 'US' and product != blank
    capture us_cb_approved
      render 'sbs-us-eligibility', product: product, scope: 'approved'
    endcapture
    capture us_cb_scoped
      render 'sbs-us-eligibility', product: product, scope: 'compliance_block'
    endcapture
    unless us_cb_approved contains 'DENY' or us_cb_scoped contains 'DENY'
      assign us_cb_render = true
    endunless
  endif

  assign us_cb_show_iso = false
  if us_cb_render
    capture us_cb_iso
      render 'sbs-us-eligibility', product: product, scope: 'iso_23351'
    endcapture
    unless us_cb_iso contains 'DENY'
      assign us_cb_show_iso = true
    endunless
  endif
-%}
{%- if us_cb_render -%}
  <div class="product-block us-compliance-block" data-us-compliance-block>
    <style>
      .us-compliance-block{border:1px solid #e8e8e1;border-radius:4px;padding:1em 1.15em;margin-top:1em;font-size:0.9em;line-height:1.5}
      .us-compliance-block__list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
      .us-compliance-block__item{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.35em;padding:0.15em 0}
      .us-compliance-block__label{font-weight:600}
      .us-compliance-block__note{margin:0.65em 0 0;color:#5a5a5a}
      @media (max-width:768px){.us-compliance-block__item{flex-direction:column;gap:0}}
    </style>
    <ul class="us-compliance-block__list">
      <li class="us-compliance-block__item">
        <span class="us-compliance-block__label">US electrical configuration:</span>
        <span>120V</span>
      </li>
      <li class="us-compliance-block__item">
        <span class="us-compliance-block__label">Compliance:</span>
        <span>UL Listed</span>
      </li>
      {%- if us_cb_show_iso -%}
        <li class="us-compliance-block__item">
          <span class="us-compliance-block__label">Acoustic performance:</span>
          <span>ISO 23351-1</span>
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}
    </ul>
    <p class="us-compliance-block__note">
      Available in the United States by quotation. Delivery, installation, taxes and duties will be confirmed in your quotation.
    </p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
